      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOTCH BLASTER (8) promising type yet to be beaten in two tries. Had the inside latest and too good again, scoring by 4 lengths at this track (19.77). Can continue the winning form. AVALON BEACH (1) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (20.00) at Capalaba in a Grade 6 over 366m. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. TRAVELLING DEAN (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (26.01) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from seven starts. Should be about the money. TEA ROSE (3) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
